  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "我ê心願"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>張翰緯</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人ê一生tī無仝款ê階段，有無仝款ê心願。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ē記得我細漢ê時，看著別个囡仔leh彈鋼琴，心內tsiok欣羨--ê！Hit-tsūn ê願望是想beh學鋼琴。後--來阿母辛辛苦苦去標會仔，thang hōo我實現tsit个心願，我真正tsiok感謝阮阿母--neh！到開始讀冊，除了拍拚kā冊讀hōo好、thang得著好成績以外，mā漸漸對家己ê外表有khah kuân ê要求。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">十幾歲ê囡仔kài希望得著別人ê呵咾kah肯定。到kah做老師tī學校教冊，上大ê心願就是kā家己所ē-hiáu ê智識傳hōo學生。希望學生lóng ē-tàng考tiâu理想ê學校，koh-khah重要--ê是ài做一个揣著家己人生價值、勇敢追求理想ê人。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tann我已經60 thóng歲--ah！Tsit世人上歡喜ê代誌，就是查某囝結婚koh生一个古錐ê查埔孫。家己生囝、io囝ê過程已經lóng bē記--得--ah。Tsit-má看著家己ê孫uì出世到度晬，uì食奶ê嬰仔到ē爬、ē kah人sńg ê囡仔，我感覺tsiok奇妙、tsiok心適--ê。逐擺查某囝傳孫ê相片iah是影片--來，我lóng ē看tsiok濟擺，看lóng bē siān--neh！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我tiānn-tiānn kā上帝祈禱，ē-tàng看顧我ê寶貝孫，賜伊平安kah健康；koh hōo阮翁仔某兩人有khah濟ê時間thang陪伴伊大漢。Tse就是我tsit个時tsūn上大ê心願。&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEijwK3cSBS4yXYXYUZ5-1VEQAazabo0gOeh3yY5aIMzo3ixCJmsH1FEB1kQnKCXSqoWlEPBGrFh3LoZ_NS00n27CchbedSFdLmBPQ1EONpG-44hEWDGLTDVwPXTEXTOftp92Q2aWhmMPuyhsSnytKs21DjFNRc74eWtPIePsQCWCjVFMniXYU4D1KfTSH-D/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1371%E6%9C%9F_41.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEijwK3cSBS4yXYXYUZ5-1VEQAazabo0gOeh3yY5aIMzo3ixCJmsH1FEB1kQnKCXSqoWlEPBGrFh3LoZ_NS00n27CchbedSFdLmBPQ1EONpG-44hEWDGLTDVwPXTEXTOftp92Q2aWhmMPuyhsSnytKs21DjFNRc74eWtPIePsQCWCjVFMniXYU4D1KfTSH-D/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1371%E6%9C%9F_41.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><!--more--><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-oj4pjXlqh0g-wtg0GJI4ztOB4X4CvR9tds6y-BDitMOyNTDR0m7UHiCKNpwOBXlkwyBC0h8mU-Gwvhg7YCMhpV53TaRa0B1OEJpfMhWkDwBYMSSQqpybLRWBkbh-nRyCkQEV8UrjIfVYII3ZsL-fiVwRNTT8AvxvTyfpKh-hZR2sjmUfSyJxPF200lji/s1424/371%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.png\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-oj4pjXlqh0g-wtg0GJI4ztOB4X4CvR9tds6y-BDitMOyNTDR0m7UHiCKNpwOBXlkwyBC0h8mU-Gwvhg7YCMhpV53TaRa0B1OEJpfMhWkDwBYMSSQqpybLRWBkbh-nRyCkQEV8UrjIfVYII3ZsL-fiVwRNTT8AvxvTyfpKh-hZR2sjmUfSyJxPF200lji/w450-h640/371%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.png\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: 